  "2026-09-04T16:26:03.878Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: complete all-status PM searches for Vitest 5, Vitest major, and CodSpeed peer compatibility found the closed compatible Vitest 4.1.11 refresh pm-n5ysuk and CodSpeed adoption pm-yh6t, but no owner for the 5.0.0 major. Live registry evidence on 2026-09-04: vitest 5.0.0 supports Node ^22.12 || ^24 || >=26, but mandatory @codspeed/vitest-plugin 5.7.1 declares peer vitest ^3.2 || ^4. This item remains open and unclaimed until that external peer contract is compatible."
  "2026-09-05T03:52:26.679Z","harness:codex","Live 2026-09-05 registry verification: latest CodSpeed plugin still accepts Vitest ^3.2 || ^4, excluding available Vitest and coverage-v8 5.0.0. No compatible wanted update exists. Keep the canonical migration open and unclaimed; do not bypass the mandatory performance gate peer contract."
